starts with building an SDK for the Web&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.840
that is a joy for developers to use, lowers&nbsp;
the barrier of contribution for everyone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.640
no matter how skilled, and most importantly&nbsp;
delivers a great experience for end users.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.400
We choose to build on the Web because we love&nbsp;
open platforms and we believe in developer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.880
freedom. Next.js is the result of an open&nbsp;
collaboration with more than 1800 contributors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:07.600
thousands of companies and partners like&nbsp;
Google Chrome and the React team at Facebook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.760
